{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/finalBoss.yarn-darkFuthark-10863": "黑暗符文",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10864": "BEN: 就是那老头故事里的地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10865": "NIKOLAI: 肯定是最高的山。空气居然没更稀薄，倒有点意外。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10866": "JUNA: 有风系魔法，和飞空艇周围用的那种一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10867": "JUNA: 不过这个大得连边都看不见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10868": "ALEXANDRA: 我还以为就是……一座山。这些建筑是怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10869": "ALEXANDRA: 真有人把这些东西一路搬上来了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10870": "CORDELIA: 真相远比这离奇。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10871": "CORDELIA: 古代见证者记载，此地原是一座直入云霄的高塔，是希纳尔帝国最辉煌的成就。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10872": "CORDELIA: 所有史料都说，帝国覆灭时，山峰“落在”了高塔之上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10873": "CORDELIA: 至于如何发生、为何发生……我们一无所知。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakArrival-10874": "AGATA: 别在一个地方停留太久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10875": "<align=\"center\">朝圣者，听令。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10876": "NIKOLAI: 那是什么鬼东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10877": "CORDELIA: 想必是山的声音——确切说，是塔的声音。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10878": "<align=\"center\">应向国王与王后献上同等的敬意。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10879": "<align=\"center\">均分汝等人数，莫要招致王者之怒。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10880": "BEN: 谁给我解释解释？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10881": "CORDELIA: 原本矗立于此的高塔，是希纳尔帝国的祭仪中心。各属地的朝圣者必须来此致敬。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10882": "CORDELIA: 那对自称国王与王后的人，彼此长期暗中争斗，因而所有尊荣都要均分。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10883": "ALEXANDRA: 你怎么知道这么多？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10884": "CORDELIA: 任何一门《魔法史》入门课，都会教这些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10885": "AGATA: 是，我也听过一些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10886": "CORDELIA: 希纳尔人是魔法的发现者……也可能是发明者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10887": "CORDELIA: 许多细节都不确定。我们只能从其他文明的记载中了解他们，他们自己的记录已被彻底抹去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10888": "JEROME: 看这里的样子，传说似乎是真的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10889": "<align=\"center\">朝圣者，分队而行。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosDivide-10890": "CORDELIA: 但愿不是所有传说都是真的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-ascentPartyLeader-10891": "JUNA: 另一边见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-ascentPartyLeader-10892": "ALEXANDRA: 我们，嗯，在那边会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-ascentPartyLeader-10893": "BEN: 知道了，放心。你们忙你们的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-ascentPartyLeader-10894": "CORDELIA: 去吧，一会儿见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-ascentPartyLeader-10895": "NIKOLAI: 到出口会合……管它通到哪儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-ascentPartyLeader-10896": "JEROME: 想必很快就能再见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-ascentPartyLeader-10897": "AGATA: 没时间耽搁了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-unifyNibarosPeak-10898": "NIKOLAI: 得等人来会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-unifyNibarosPeak-10899": "CORDELIA: 其他人应该随时会到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-unifyNibarosPeak-10900": "JUNA: 但愿其他人快点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-unifyNibarosPeak-10901": "BEN: 但愿他们没迷路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-unifyNibarosPeak-10902": "AGATA: 他们最好快点……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-unifyNibarosPeak-10903": "ALEXANDRA: 希望大家都平安。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-unifyNibarosPeak-10904": "JEROME: 接下来等吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-unifyNibarosPeak-10905": "NIKOLAI: 得等人来会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-leavingNibarosDivide-10906": "NIKOLAI: 得和其他人会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-leavingNibarosDivide-10907": "CORDELIA: 必须先与同伴会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-leavingNibarosDivide-10908": "JUNA: 等等，先把人聚齐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-leavingNibarosDivide-10909": "BEN: 慢着，得全队到齐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-leavingNibarosDivide-10910": "AGATA: 不能丢下其他人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-leavingNibarosDivide-10911": "ALEXANDRA: 我们是不是忘了其他人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-leavingNibarosDivide-10912": "JEROME: 继续之前，得先等其他人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-leavingNibarosDivide-10913": "ZIKARON: ……其他人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10914": "JUNA: 我们……没走错吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10915": "ALEXANDRA: 这里到底是什么地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10916": "JEROME: 这些难道是……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10917": "AGATA: 这里难道就是……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10918": "NIKOLAI: 这里什么情况？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10919": "BEN: 这地方弄得不错啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10920": "ZIKARON: ……危险……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10921": "CORDELIA: 这是王家御道的一部分。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10922": "CORDELIA: 它们连接希纳尔帝国各地，是往来捷径。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10923": "CORDELIA: 历代都有法师偶然闯进这里。通常，没有第二次。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-cordeliaAstralExplain-10924": "CORDELIA: 无论如何，继续前进。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-jeromeAstralExplain-10925": "JUNA: 我们……没走错吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-jeromeAstralExplain-10926": "ALEXANDRA: 这里到底是什么地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-jeromeAstralExplain-10927": "AGATA: 这里难道就是……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-jeromeAstralExplain-10928": "NIKOLAI: 这里什么情况？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-jeromeAstralExplain-10929": "BEN: 这地方弄得不错啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-jeromeAstralExplain-10930": "ZIKARON: ……危险……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-jeromeAstralExplain-10931": "JEROME: 这里应该就是真正的星界。我忘了它古时的名字。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-jeromeAstralExplain-10932": "JEROME: 大多数人都是偶然来到这里，也不会再来第二次。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-jeromeAstralExplain-10933": "JEROME: 看来，这是唯一的前路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-agataAstralExplain-10934": "JUNA: 我们……没走错吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-agataAstralExplain-10935": "ALEXANDRA: 这里到底是什么地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-agataAstralExplain-10936": "NIKOLAI: 这里什么情况？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-agataAstralExplain-10937": "BEN: 这地方弄得不错啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-agataAstralExplain-10938": "ZIKARON: ……危险……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-agataAstralExplain-10939": "AGATA: 这是星界。记载里，有法师来这里躲避守护者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-agataAstralExplain-10940": "AGATA: 我们也算亲眼见识过了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-agataAstralExplain-10941": "AGATA: 理论上，它只是魔法道路网，是各地之间的捷径。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-agataAstralExplain-10942": "AGATA: 所以……继续往前走，应该就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10943": "JUNA: 我们……没走错吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10944": "ALEXANDRA: 这里到底是什么地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10945": "AGATA: 这里难道就是……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10946": "NIKOLAI: 这里什么情况？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10947": "BEN: 这地方弄得不错啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10948": "ZIKARON: ……危险……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10949": "JUNA: 就是那些魔法道路嘛。大概是这些“希纳尔人”造的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10950": "JUNA: 有不少古老法术，专门把人类挡在外面……可对其他动物从来没用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10951": "JUNA: 我们有时走这里抄近路，或者在这里碰头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-junaAstralExplain-10952": "JUNA: 但不喜欢久留，这里还有别的东西。快走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-alexAstralExplain-10953": "NIKOLAI: 这里什么情况？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-alexAstralExplain-10954": "BEN: 这地方弄得不错啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-alexAstralExplain-10955": "ZIKARON: ……危险……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-alexAstralExplain-10956": "ALEXANDRA: 我来过这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-alexAstralExplain-10957": "ALEXANDRA: 遇到过一个人……其实，也不确定是不是人。也许就是那些“希那什么尔人”？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-alexAstralExplain-10958": "ALEXANDRA: 他说了些道路、桥梁……还有法律？当时我应该在睡觉。所以……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-alexAstralExplain-10959": "ALEXANDRA: 总之，上次……还算顺利。继续走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10960": "JUNA: 大家又聚齐了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10961": "NIKOLAI: 有人知道接下来会遇到什么吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10962": "CORDELIA: 可惜，没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10963": "BEN: 这些东西到底多老？看着很古老，可又……没那么旧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10964": "ALEXANDRA: 是啊……我们店里的地板每隔几年就得修。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10965": "ALEXANDRA: 可这里的路面还挺完好……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10966": "CORDELIA: 据我们所知，希纳尔人在四千多年前消失了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10967": "NIKOLAI: 人消失了，东西却完好留下？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10968": "NIKOLAI: 哪有打得这么干净的仗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10969": "CORDELIA: 那不是战争。至少，不是我们理解的战争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10970": "CORDELIA: 希纳尔腹地遭受了一场持续很久的魔法灾难。古代见证者称其为“风暴与黑暗之年”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10971": "CORDELIA: 灾难结束后，周边诸国派遣侦察队进入帝国首都。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10972": "CORDELIA: 他们只找到这些遗迹，里面充斥着危险的怪物。一个希纳尔族人也不见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10973": "AGATA: 那以后很长一段时间，魔法都消失了……至少人类失去了魔法，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10974": "JEROME: 又过了近两千年，人类才重新发现魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10975": "CORDELIA: 许多最古老的法术，则再也没有找回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosUnifyExplain-10976": "BEN: 那到底是坏事……还是好事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10977": "<align=\"center\">甄别必须继续……</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10978": "NIKOLAI: 可能马上就要接敌了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10979": "CORDELIA: 这是最后的守卫？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10980": "JUNA: 这话听着可不妙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10981": "BEN: 又有东西要杀我们了，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10982": "AGATA: 小心。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10983": "ALEXANDRA: 糟了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10984": "JEROME: 拔出武器。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10985": "NIKOLAI: 可能马上就要接敌了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-penultimateBossScene-10986": "<align=\"center\">两位陛下归来之前，神圣使命永不终止。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakCrestScene-10987": "CORDELIA: 应该快到峰顶了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakCrestScene-10988": "ALEXANDRA: 真奇怪……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakCrestScene-10989": "ALEXANDRA: 像是山底下有什么东西……一直在尖叫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakCrestScene-10990": "ALEXANDRA: 声音越来越大。还是说……我们越来越近了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-peakCrestScene-10991": "NIKOLAI: 准备应付任何情况。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-10992": "URALT: 这么说……你们来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-10993": "URALT: 命运很快就会作出选择。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-10994": "NIKOLAI: 别再这样了，奥斯伦已经赢不了这场战争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-10995": "NIKOLAI: 你这样做，只会给我们树立新的敌人，让我们的人民陷入危险。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-10996": "URALT: 你什么都不懂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-10997": "URALT: 想要生存，就必须斗争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-10998": "URALT: 永恒斗争是这个世界的生存法则，不愿斗争的人，就没有存在的权利。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-10999": "URALT: 在历史的熔炉里，不是铁锤，就是铁砧，奥斯伦必须成为铁锤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11000": "CORDELIA: 在你的国家，这套说辞真能说服人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11001": "CORDELIA: 事到如今，你该明白，其他世界和你们不同，却依然繁荣。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11002": "URALT: 说得出如此天真的话，还觉得蠢的是我？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11003": "URALT: 你们国家的财富足以引得邻邦觊觎，却完全没有抵御入侵的准备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11004": "URALT: 掌握武器与魔法的人，必然会成为那些没有武器和魔法之人的主人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11005": "AGATA: 别浪费时间了，他必须死。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11006": "URALT: 哈！就是它，生命的火花！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11007": "URALT: 不论命运今日如何裁决，记住：即使世界分裂，人类的本性也从未改变。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11008": "URALT: 为了生存，就永远要夺取生存所需，消灭那些想分走你一份的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11009": "URALT: 只要世上还有不同民族，就会国与国相争，以守住魔法，掌控未来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11010": "URALT: 那么……开始吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11011": "BEN: 真就这么结束了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11012": "BEN: 接下来呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11013": "CORDELIA: 元素的力量正在汇聚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11014": "AGATA: 和大贤者的故事一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11015": "NIKOLAI: 我们能做乌拉尔特做过的事？他们四个人当年做的事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11016": "NIKOLAI: 该由我们决定了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11017": "NIKOLAI: 决定什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11018": "CORDELIA: 很简单。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11019": "CORDELIA: 必须让世界恢复最初的模样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11020": "BEN: 为什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11021": "CORDELIA: 因为那才是世界正常而自然的状态，分裂令大多数地方遭遇浩劫，不是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11022": "CORDELIA: 几乎整个人类历史，乃至人类迈向文明的全部历程，都发生在统一的世界里。我们难道不该让所有人重返那样的世界吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11023": "AGATA: 我想我得同意，怎么都比堤刻现在的局面好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11024": "AGATA: 要是恢复世界原貌能终止混乱，就必须去做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11025": "JEROME: 可代价呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11026": "NIKOLAI: 什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11027": "JEROME: 世界分裂带来了饥荒、战争[oxfordComma /]还有一连串自然灾难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11028": "JEROME: 谁知道把它逆转，又会发生什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11029": "NIKOLAI: 总比现在好吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11030": "NIKOLAI: 战争还在打，不管哪方获胜，都会血流成河，死上数百万人，我们得有其他国家来阻止这一切。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11031": "JEROME: 我会尽我所能帮助他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11032": "JEROME: 但作为医生，我也宣誓不伤害他人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11033": "CORDELIA: 而你已无数次违背誓言，就在刚才也是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11034": "JEROME: 那不一样，你很清楚，拿起武器踏上战场的人，也就接受了此后可能发生的一切。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11035": "BEN: 能不能先等等？你们国家的人这么怕香料，让我开份菜单都得提心吊胆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11036": "BEN: 现在倒要替所有人决定整个世界怎么运作？我可不觉得该这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11037": "NIKOLAI: 总得做些什么吧，不能走了这么远，却什么都不做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11038": "JUNA: 真非得做点什么吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11039": "JUNA: 我知道世界分裂让人类受了很多苦……可受苦的还有很多别的生灵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11040": "JUNA: 有动物失去了全部食物来源，鸟群兽群被分开，甚至有些物种惨遭灭绝。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11041": "JUNA: 要是它们现在也能投票，情况就会大不相同。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11042": "CORDELIA: 所以……要投票？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11043": "CORDELIA: 好吧，既然齐卡隆恐怕没法表达意见……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11044": "CORDELIA: 亲爱的，那就取决于你了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11045": "ALEXANDRA: 听我说……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11046": "ALEXANDRA: 感觉这趟冒险已经走了很久，可其实不久前，我还只是想经营好一家杂货店。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11047": "ALEXANDRA: 现在事情结束……我大概还会回去，对我来说那就够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11048": "ALEXANDRA: （我到底想说什么……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11049": "ALEXANDRA: 那个死掉的人……总理……我见过他，和他单独待过，我只确定一件事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11050": "ALEXANDRA: 他最后那番话是有目的的，就是要让我们照着他的想法去想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11051": "ALEXANDRA: 操纵别人的想法就是他的老本行，他就是那样的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11052": "ALEXANDRA: 我想他就是要我们在维持世界分裂和让世界重新合一之间做选择，不管选哪一个，他都会满意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11053": "ALEXANDRA: 因为不管怎样，世界都会因他而改变，所有人都会因此记住他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11054": "CORDELIA: 可惜，摆在眼前的就是这两个选择。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11055": "BEN: 真的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11056": "BEN: 要是她说得对……我跟你们说，那混蛋听着和我见过的大半混蛋都一样……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11057": "BEN: 凭什么遂他的意？不如偏跟他对着干。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11058": "CORDELIA: 一如既往，真是高见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11059": "NIKOLAI: 等等，他说得对。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11060": "NIKOLAI: 军队里教过，敌人会逼你按他们希望的方式行动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11061": "NIKOLAI: 可你不必上钩，想出敌人意料之外的新策略，才是我们该做的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11062": "JEROME: 找个更折中的办法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11063": "ALEXANDRA: 可我也不知道，究竟能有什么别的办法……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-uraltFinalConfrontation-11064": "AGATA: 我有个主意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosBackToFront-11065": "传送至迷宫入口？（随时可以传送回来。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosBackToFront-11066": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosBackToFront-11067": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosFrontToBack-11068": "传送至最终对决处？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosFrontToBack-11069": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nibarosPeak.yarn-nibarosFrontToBack-11070": "是"
}
